++* **The Guard**: `execution_guard/repo_integrity_guard_v1.py` runs on GitHub PRs via `.github/workflows/repo-integrity-guard.yml`. If `canonical/runtime/BOUND_CAPABILITY_REGISTRY_V1.json` adds more than 3 capabilities relative to `base`, it fails with `CAPABILITY_REGISTRATION_FLOOD`. If any capability ID contains words like `frontier`, `singularity`, `reality`, or `totality`, it fails with `CAPABILITY_SELF_AGGRANDIZEMENT`.
